@page "/terms"

<PageTitle>Terms of Service | Elevated Notary Services</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="Terms of Service for Elevated Notary Services including notarial disclaimers, appointment policies, billing, and Tennessee jurisdiction." />
</HeadContent>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Legal &amp; Compliance</span>
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p>Effective Date: @DateTime.UtcNow.ToString("MMMM d, yyyy") &bull; Elevated Notary Services (Cleveland, Tennessee)</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
        <div class="card" style="gap:1.1rem;">
            <h2>1. Notarial Disclaimer (Non-Attorney Notice)</h2>
            <p>
                <strong>I AM NOT AN ATTORNEY LICENSED TO PRACTICE LAW IN THE STATE OF TENNESSEE AND I MAY NOT GIVE LEGAL ADVICE OR ACCEPT FEES FOR LEGAL ADVICE.</strong> Elevated Notary Services provides impartial notarial and signing coordination services only.
            </p>

            <h2>2. Identification &amp; Signer Readiness</h2>
            <p>
                All signers must appear willingly, be alert and aware of the transaction, and present valid, unexpired government-issued photo identification acceptable under applicable state law. Notarization cannot be completed if identification or statutory requirements are not met.
            </p>

            <h2>3. Fees, Billing, Cancellations &amp; Disputes</h2>
            <p>
                Service, travel, printing, and coordination fees are disclosed prior to appointment confirmation or governed by written partner fee schedules. Electronic payments processed through Stripe, Square, PayPal, or invoicing platforms are due per the agreed terms. Travel and print fees may remain payable for late cancellations or no-shows after a signing agent has printed documents or been dispatched. Billing questions or disputes may be directed to <a href="mailto:Bhsmith@elevatednotaryservs.com" style="text-decoration:underline;">Bhsmith@elevatednotaryservs.com</a>.
            </p>

            <h2>4. Third-Party Portals &amp; RON Platforms</h2>
            <p>
                Links to Notary Everyday, Google Calendar, JotForm, and compliant Remote Online Notarization (RON) platforms are provided for your convenience and are governed by each provider's terms of service.
            </p>

            <h2>5. Governing Law</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom:0;">
                These Terms of Service are governed by the laws of the State of Tennessee without regard to conflict-of-law principles. For questions regarding these terms, contact Elevated Notary Services at 130 Bernham Dr NW, Cleveland, TN 37312 or call <a href="tel:4233758770" style="text-decoration:underline;">(423) 375-8770</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
